      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>The final delivery and uncrating protocol at Motihari mandates strict adherence to daylight verification procedures. All goods must be inspected under natural light to ensure clarity in identifying any transit damage or discrepancies. The receiving team is required to cross-reference every arriving item against the original inventory bilty.</p>
