<p>Once inventory verification is complete, the testing phase begins for all electrical and mechanical components. Technicians must power up appliances to check for functional integrity, ensuring that switches, displays, and moving parts operate without fault. Mechanical items require a thorough visual and operational check to confirm that no internal components were displaced during transit.</p>
