<p>Following successful testing, the focus shifts to the meticulous placement of clean furniture and sensitive equipment. Items must be positioned according to the pre-approved layout plan, ensuring that heavy pieces do not obstruct walkways or damage flooring.</p>
<p>Special care is taken to maintain the cleanliness of upholstery and finishes, using protective gloves and clean cloths during handling. This stage emphasizes aesthetic presentation and organizational clarity, ensuring that the workspace or residence looks professional and orderly from the moment the movers depart.</p>

<p>Finally, the swift removal of all packing debris is critical to maintaining site hygiene. Cardboard boxes, bubble wrap, foam inserts, and plastic straps must be collected immediately after unpacking. The crew is responsible for bundling and removing this waste from the premises to prevent clutter and potential tripping hazards.</p>
<p>This rapid cleanup ensures that the client can begin using the space without delay or inconvenience. By executing this protocol with precision, the delivery team guarantees a seamless transition from transit to usability, upholding the high standards of service expected in the Motihari region.</p>

